<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3152] Client node&apos;s addresses are registered in IP finder</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3152</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently client node register its addresses in IP finder and never deregisters them. Also looks like coordinator address is also not removed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The simple test that shows this behavior is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12970341">IGNITE-3152</key>
            <summary>Client node&apos;s addresses are registered in IP finder</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
